HST Office: "Phiên bản trước" on the Info page of the File panel.

- sfx2 File ▸ Info (hstbackstage.ui, hstbackstagewindow.*): a "Phiên bản trước" button after "Thiết lập USB
  Token". It closes the panel and runs org.hst.office.vi:PreviousVersions of the bundled extension, the dialog that
  lists the copies of the document's file kept before each save overwrote it (Khôi phục, Mở xem). The Tabbed UI has
  no menu bar; the classic File menu gets the same command from the extension's Addons.xcu. Labels of HST commands
  are Vietnamese in every UI language, as in the HST menu.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: extension side tests/unit/test_version_*.py; GUI check of the Info page pending (Windows, macOS, Linux).
